---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | TravAmigo" description="Terms and Conditions for TravAmigo">
  <main class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Welcome to TravAmigo (https://travamigo.com/). By accessing and using our website and services, you agree to the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.</p>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
            <p>By using TravAmigo (“we,” “us,” or “our”), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions (“Terms”) and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please refrain from using our website.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. Services</h3>
            <p>We provide travel-related services, including flight bookings, hotel reservations, car rentals, and vacation packages. All services are subject to availability, and pricing may change without notice.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. User Account</h3>
            <p>You may need to create an account to book services. You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information and are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and password.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Booking & Payment</h3>
            <p>When booking through TravAmigo, you agree to pay all fees, including taxes, service charges, and applicable costs. Payment methods accepted include standard credit/debit cards and UPI. Confirmations will be sent to the email provided, and it’s your responsibility to verify booking details.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Cancellations & Refunds</h3>
            <p>Cancellation policies vary by service provider (e.g., airlines, hotels). We are not responsible for any cancellations, delays, or changes to your bookings. For cancellations or refunds, please check the specific provider’s terms.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. Travel Documents & Requirements</h3>
            <p>It is your responsibility to ensure you have the necessary travel documents, such as passports and visas. We are not liable for any travel restrictions or issues arising from missing documents.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">7. User Conduct</h3>
            <p>You agree to use our site for lawful purposes only. You may not misuse the site to harm others, transmit viruses, or engage in fraudulent activity. Violating this may result in account termination.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">8. Intellectual Property</h3>
            <p>All content on the website, including text, images, and logos, is owned by TravAmigo or its licensors and is protected by copyright laws. You may not use any content without permission.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">9. Limitation of Liability</h3>
            <p>We are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the website or services. You use the site at your own risk.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">10. Third-Party Links</h3>
            <p>Our website may link to third-party sites. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or services provided by these external sites.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">11. Privacy</h3>
            <p>By using our services, you consent to the collection and use of your data as described in our <a href="/privacy" class="text-purple-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">12. Governing Law</h3>
            <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes will be resolved in the appropriate courts of jurisdiction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>